into difficulties with the PHP software we used to use on the old
(intel-based) web server.  The problem, as described to me by the person
who's trying to install the software, lies in that the people that coded
PHP made it for an intel platform, and didn't take into account the
problems associated with an alpha computer (basically, the size of
integers...).  I'm more than willing to go through and fix the problems
myself, however, I'd like to know if someone's already done it (why
reinvent the wheel?).  Thanks in advance for any help!

