MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; charset=US-ASCII

On Mon, 10 Aug 1998, Linh C. Nguyen wrote:

> I have problem with IPFWADM when I run it.. I got message:  Protocol not
> install.  when my kernel did have TCP/IP..  What else i need? 

You need to recompile your kernel with IP_FIREWALL support.

If you want to do masquerading, you'll also need IP_MASQERADING and
IP_FORWARDING.  Do not enable IP_FORWARDING if you are not doing a
masquerading firewall and are going to use proxies.

