The statement above does not say very much without a lot of details.
There is no "the g77" at the moment and, as many people found, libraries
are here extremely important and not necessarily a compiler generated
code.

In a real life situation I got, for example, a report from somebody who
had a really hard time with a program they needed and which depends
heavily on elementary functions and which was unacceptably slow.
