Oddly enough, "Permission Denied" is the same error message that is =
displayed when a Linux box tries to mount a network volume but does not =
have proper DNS registration (i.e. MX, CNAME, and ADDRESS records).  Try =
forward and reverse nslookups of the machine in question.  This *may* be =
what is causing you grief.

