96 of Multia MultiClient Desktop - Service Information - PN: EK-MULTS-IN.
C01

Port A
2	TXD
3	RXD
4	RTS
5	CTS
6	DSR
7	GND
8	DCD
20	DTR
22	RI

Port B
11	DTR_2
12	DCD_2
13	CTS_2
14	TXD_2
16	RXD_2
19	RTS_2
23	DSR_2
25	RI_2

And I think this part can be bought for 20$ or so from
www.starshipcorp.com (I think that's the URL), if this wiring seems too
daunting.  If you are doing this for yourself, wiring it won't be too bad,
but fur business use buying the part would be less of a hassle.  The
Y-cablle's PN is 17-04047-01-A01 or BC25X-1F if you care.

Jeff



