Some Powerstorm taxonomy for anyone interested:

3D10:  S3 Trio64/2MB
3D30:  TGA2/2MB
4D20:  TGA2/16MB
4D10T: 3DLabs Permedia2/4-8MB
4D30T: E & S RealImage 1000/15MB Framebuffer + 0-16MB Texture (24bit
Zbuffer, 24bit clr)4D40T: Intergraph/16MB Framebuffer + 4-32MB Texture
(24bit Zbuffer, 24bit color)
4D50T: Intergraph/16MB Framebuffer + 4-32MB Texture (24bit Zbuffer,
24bit color)
4D51T: Intergraph/32MB Framebuffer + 4-16MB Texture (32bit Zbuffer,
24bit color)
4D60T: Intergraph/32MB Framebuffer + 4-32MB Texture (32bit Zbuffer,
24bit color)

HTH,
Wai-Sun

