Hi,

setserial command is usually in either in rc.serial or rc.local but
can go where ever you want to put it. 

check out 

/usr/doc/ppp-2.3.3* (directory) and check out the file
README.linux

This will show how to turn on debugging to get more information to
determine what is actually going wrong with the connection. It is also
a good document to troubleshot ppp connections. This should give some
good information then take a good look at the ppp-howto.

Good luck.




