Jack Dongarra has a similar project which machine-generates
architecture-specific high-level source to do cache blocking for
Blas. I would assume that Goto's hand-generated assembly will beat
this, for the ones he's done, and Intel's i386 assembly blas are
probably also faster; that library is complete.

It would be nice if someone would put together a full alpha BLAS with
the fastest implementation of each routine.

-- g


