If this is what I think it is, these are Turbochannel boxes. NO PCI, a
prorietary ( and short-lived) card bus, and not particualry supported on
Linux, Although one of the BSD flavours is said to run to some degree.
Everything about them is about as proprietary-from-hell as can be.
These were the very first Alpha machines DEC made in any volume..


