Hi there

I had some problem with my locale settings. The default setting is 
iso_8859_1 which seems not to exist on my system (PWS500, 2.0.34, RH
5.1)
Starting perl or emacs always gave "locale not supported" errors
I tried to find some nice way to change this setting, without success.

